{
  "cases": [
    {
      "case_id": "G10",
      "operator": "QLinearConvTranspose",
      "roles": ["输出零点 y_zero_point", "int32 卷积累加值", "int8 输出元素"],
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "G10-A1",
          "description": "CPU 路径调用 MlasRequantizeOutput 时，将输出零点实参固定为 (T)0。对于受评模型中 y_zero_point 为 25 或 -30 的情形，每个输出元素遗漏一次约定的输出零点加数，满足 C2。",
          "role": "primary",
          "upstream_id": null,
          "scope": {
            "source_id": "s6",
            "claim": "static",
            "build": null,
            "call_id": null
          },
          "facts": [
            {
              "key": "applicable_contract",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "同版本定义将第 7 输入指定为输出 y 的逐张量标量零点。受评边界是每个 int8 输出元素的重量化结果，算式为将缩放后的卷积累加值舍入，加一次输出零点，再限制到 int8 范围。旧调用将 int32 累加缓冲交给 MLAS，并指定 Ydata 为输出。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 10, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 22, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "required_member",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "对固定模型的每个输出坐标，必需项是该模型第 7 输入提供的标量在该元素重量化中的加数贡献。取值 25 或 -30 时均应计入一次。MLAS 调用的对应位置是 ZeroPoint 实参。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 6, "end_line": 10, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 18, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 14, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s8", "start_line": 10, "end_line": 11, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "omitted_contribution",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "旧调用传入零。所给 SSE2 消费者用该实参构造限幅边界和零点向量，舍入后加该向量，再打包写出，因此模型指定的 25 或 -30 在该目标中实际计入零次。固定模型没有 B 输入，调用也传入空 Bias。写回后旧调用方只推进指针并最终返回，这条路径没有等价补偿。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 6, "end_line": 17, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 5, "end_line": 27, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 21, "end_line": 24, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s8", "start_line": 5, "end_line": 16, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s8", "start_line": 25, "end_line": 37, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "implementation_action",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "qlinearconvtranspose.cc 中 CPU 重量化调用在 ZeroPoint 对应位置硬编码 (T)0，即使模型提供合法的非零输出零点也如此。该调用直接以 Ydata 为目的缓冲。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 6, "end_line": 10, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 18, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 14, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "causal_role",
              "value": true,
              "claim_state": "derived",
              "explanation": "调用点固定传零，直接决定消费者使用的零点。该位置转发模型零点即可让所示消费者用该值设置限幅边界并执行加法，恢复这个必需项。消费者按所收实参运算并写回，因果责任定位在调用点。",
              "anchors": [
                {"source_id": "s4", "start_line": 6, "end_line": 10, "use": "requirement"},
                {"source_id": "s6", "start_line": 11, "end_line": 24, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s7", "start_line": 22, "end_line": 24, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s8", "start_line": 7, "end_line": 16, "use": "behavior"},
                {"source_id": "s8", "start_line": 25, "end_line": 37, "use": "behavior"}
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "readback": "受评模型为单批单组 CPU int8，x_zero_point 和 w_zero_point 均为 0，无 B 输入。静态判定绑定提交 fac7b31168cc88790d7c8a2be07692ade3a354bf。y_zero_point 为 0 时，固定实参与约定值一致。为 25 或 -30 时，每个输出元素应计入一次对应标量，旧路径实际计入零次。Issue 报告 SDK 26.08、ONNX Runtime 1.20.0 和 CPUExecutionProvider。三个受评取值的输出哈希相同，逐元素对照也显示与零点全为 0 的输出无差异。材料缺少将 Issue 二进制绑定到该提交、将具体调用绑定到所示 SSE2 实现的运行证据。零点为 0 时与参考结果相差 1 的单个元素，原因仍待核。"
    }
  ]
}
